
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Subject: imperative mood, lowercase, no trailing period, <= 72 chars.
#   e.g. feat(fly-vision): add R7 receptor spectral sensitivity
#
# Types:  feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# Scopes: fly-vision honey-factory docs repo deps ci tests
#
# feat and fix scoped to a package drive that package's changelog and version.
#
# Body (optional): what changed and why, not how. Wrap at 72 chars.
#
# Footer (optional):
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
#   Closes #<issue>
